{
 "duration": 43.627,
 "voice": "am_michael",
 "speed": 1.08,
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "This man got rich selling a pet",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 1.96
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "that was literally a rock.",
   "start": 2.31,
   "end": 3.531
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "In nineteen seventy-five, Gary Dahl had an idea.",
   "start": 3.681,
   "end": 6.843
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "You see, a rock never needed feeding,",
   "start": 6.993,
   "end": 8.993
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "walking, or cleaning up after.",
   "start": 9.393,
   "end": 11.101
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "His customers could already find one outside.",
   "start": 11.251,
   "end": 13.648
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "So why would anybody pay for it?",
   "start": 13.798,
   "end": 15.561
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "Because Gary sold the whole joke.",
   "start": 15.711,
   "end": 17.516
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "Each rock came in a little carrier",
   "start": 17.666,
   "end": 19.546
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "text": "with air holes and a bed of wood shavings.",
   "start": 19.606,
   "end": 22.049
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "text": "He even included a training manual.",
   "start": 22.199,
   "end": 24.26
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "text": "Teaching it to stay? Unbeatable.",
   "start": 24.41,
   "end": 26.321
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "text": "The price was three dollars and ninety-five cents.",
   "start": 26.471,
   "end": 29.149
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "text": "And by Christmas, more than a million had sold.",
   "start": 29.299,
   "end": 31.852
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "text": "Our skeptical shopper suddenly wanted two.",
   "start": 32.002,
   "end": 34.356
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "text": "The craze faded the following year,",
   "start": 34.506,
   "end": 36.316
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "text": "but Gary had become a millionaire.",
   "start": 36.746,
   "end": 38.393
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "text": "The pet did absolutely nothing.",
   "start": 38.543,
   "end": 40.159
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "text": "Its owner was the one who fetched the money.",
   "start": 40.309,
   "end": 42.477
  }
 ]
}